### Base URL variable
@baseUrl = http://localhost:10080

###
### 1. Create a new session — response handler captures sessionId automatically
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions

> {%
client.global.set("sessionId", JSON.parse(response.body).id);
%}


###
### 2. Join a session (Alice) — response handler captures userId automatically
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice"
}

> {%
client.global.set("userId", JSON.parse(response.body).id);
%}

###
### 3. Get session by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}?userId={{userId}}

###
### 4. Join a session — second user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob"
}

###
### 5. Vote (userId filled automatically from request #3 response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": {{userId}},
  "vote": "5"
}

###
### 6. Show votes (reveal all votes to all participants)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/show
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": {{userId}}
}


###
### 7. Clear votes (reset round, keep users in session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/clear
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": {{userId}}
}